The '''Rare Long Spiked Wristband''' was initially released as one of the Monthly Member Gifts during July 2011, and is obtainable as a prize in The Forgotten Desert & Tiki Trouble. It is also commonly referred to as 'Rare Long Wrist,' or 'Long Wrist'.

